# Agent devlog contract

**Start:** `guidelines/agent-devlog-index.md`  
**Workflow:** `guidelines/agent-devlog-contract.md`

Before fragile edits, read the matching **topic** devlog (`guidelines/agent-devlog-*.md`), not only session logs (`dev-log-*.md`).

After rule-changing work: update the topic devlog + in-repo comments / cursor rules per contract.
